    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to the world after the Blackout.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2005. Civilization collapsed after a global energy blackout.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What remains of humanity now hides underground, sealed inside bunkers to escape the horrors roaming the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are R2-P23H, an autonomous maintenance unit assigned to Bunker 01, buried deep within a forgotten forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disembodied voice gives you orders through a flickering monitor.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the forest... seems alive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something out there. Something that listens. Something that doesn't want you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/bf53e80b562c69a6e44ee77a7dc33000.poster.avif?t=1753038293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/bf53e80b562c69a6e44ee77a7dc33000.webm?t=1753038293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/bf53e80b562c69a6e44ee77a7dc33000.mp4?t=1753038293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive this first-person psychological horror experience.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying post-apocalyptic world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve twisted puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid what moves through the fog.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And uncover the truth about who you are... or what you've become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/05dd3288c8757d9d0d66aa4fc64f77cd.avif?t=1753038293\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Are you just a machine?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were made to obey. To maintain. To survive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the forest remembers something you've forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You dream.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hesitate.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hear your name when no one speaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And deep down... you know you shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person horror with subtle survival elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles seamlessly integrated into the environment and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets that alter your understanding of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense stealth sections: crouch, listen, and stay silent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant psychological tension \u2014 no cheap jumpscares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic story: future chapters will be released as updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/3f68606e3afc9fa5746003801a2347df.avif?t=1753038293\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Step outside. The dark is waiting.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face what remains of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/551c7367f9623fefcf14237f7efe136a.avif?t=1753038293\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to the world after the Blackout.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2005. Civilization collapsed after a global energy blackout.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What remains of humanity now hides underground, sealed inside bunkers to escape the horrors roaming the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are R2-P23H, an autonomous maintenance unit assigned to Bunker 01, buried deep within a forgotten forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disembodied voice gives you orders through a flickering monitor.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the forest... seems alive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something out there. Something that listens. Something that doesn't want you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/bf53e80b562c69a6e44ee77a7dc33000.poster.avif?t=1753038293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/bf53e80b562c69a6e44ee77a7dc33000.webm?t=1753038293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/bf53e80b562c69a6e44ee77a7dc33000.mp4?t=1753038293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive this first-person psychological horror experience.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying post-apocalyptic world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve twisted puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid what moves through the fog.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And uncover the truth about who you are... or what you've become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/05dd3288c8757d9d0d66aa4fc64f77cd.avif?t=1753038293\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Are you just a machine?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were made to obey. To maintain. To survive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the forest remembers something you've forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You dream.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hesitate.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hear your name when no one speaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And deep down... you know you shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person horror with subtle survival elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles seamlessly integrated into the environment and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets that alter your understanding of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense stealth sections: crouch, listen, and stay silent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant psychological tension \u2014 no cheap jumpscares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic story: future chapters will be released as updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/3f68606e3afc9fa5746003801a2347df.avif?t=1753038293\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Step outside. The dark is waiting.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face what remains of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687910/extras/551c7367f9623fefcf14237f7efe136a.avif?t=1753038293\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
